#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/admin/user_detail.html:72
msgid ""
"Service accounts authenticate via API keys only. They cannot log in via "
"the web interface."
msgstr "服务账户仅通过 API 密钥进行身份验证，无法通过 Web 界面登录。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/admin/user_detail.html:75
