#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1395
msgid "Under Trigger, select Push events and Merge request events."
msgstr "在 Trigger 下选择 Push events 和 Merge request events。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1396
msgid "Save, then use Test, Push events to send a first delivery."
msgstr "保存后，使用 Test → Push events 发送第一次投递。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1401
msgid ""
"In the repository, open Settings, then Webhooks, then Add webhook, and "
"pick the Gitea or Forgejo webhook type, matching the server."
msgstr ""
"在仓库中，依次打开 Settings、Webhooks、Add webhook，并根据服务器选择 Gitea 或 Forgejo 类型的 "
"Webhook。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1402
msgid ""
"Paste the webhook URL into Target URL. Keep the HTTP method POST and set "
"the POST content type to application/json."
msgstr ""
"将 Webhook URL 粘贴到 Target URL。HTTP 方法保持 POST，并将 POST content type 设为 "
"application/json。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1404
msgid ""
"Under Trigger on, choose Custom events, tick Push and Pull request, then "
"add the webhook. Test delivery sends a push."
msgstr ""
"在 Trigger on 下选择 Custom events，勾选 Push 和 Pull request，然后添加 Webhook。Test "
"delivery 会发送一次推送。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1422
msgid "No repositories connected"
msgstr "尚未连接仓库"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1423
msgid ""
"Connect a GitHub, GitLab, Gitea or Forgejo repository: commits that "
"mention an issue key, such as \"Fixes KEY-12\", or are pushed to a branch"
" named after one, are linked to the issue."
msgstr ""
"连接 GitHub、GitLab、Gitea 或 Forgejo 仓库：提及工作项键（例如“Fixes "
"KEY-12”）的提交，或推送到以工作项键命名的分支的提交，都会关联到该工作项。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1424
msgid "Connect the first repository"
msgstr "连接第一个仓库"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1437
msgid "Last delivery:"
msgstr "最近一次投递："

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1438
msgid "includes subprojects"
msgstr "包含子项目"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1440
msgid "commit commands on"
msgstr "提交命令已开启"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1441
msgid "merge automation on"
msgstr "合并自动化已开启"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1446
msgid "New secret"
msgstr "新密钥"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1479
msgid "Deliveries appear here once the forge sends its first webhook to this URL."
msgstr "代码托管平台向此 URL 发送第一个 Webhook 后，投递记录会显示在这里。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1529
msgid "Repository URL"
msgstr "仓库 URL"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1532
msgid ""
"Paste the address of the repository's page, or its clone address. "
"Provider and Repository are filled in from it."
msgstr "粘贴仓库页面的地址或其克隆地址，系统会据此填写提供商和仓库。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1536
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "撤销"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1553
msgid "Repository"
msgstr "仓库"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1556
msgid ""
"The full name as the forge shows it, owner and repository. Deliveries "
"that name another repository are ignored."
msgstr "代码托管平台上显示的完整名称，包括所有者和仓库名。指向其他仓库的投递会被忽略。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1559
msgid "Issues commits may link to"
msgstr "提交可关联的工作项"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1561
msgid "This project"
msgstr "此项目"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1562
msgid "This project and its subprojects"
msgstr "此项目及其子项目"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1564
msgid "Keys of other projects in commit messages are ignored."
msgstr "提交信息中其他项目的键会被忽略。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1567
msgid "Changes to issues"
msgstr "对工作项的更改"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1568
msgid ""
"Commit commands trust the commit author email, which anyone with push "
"access can set to any address. With commands on, anyone who can push to "
"this repository can act as any project member whose verified email they "
"use."
msgstr "提交命令信任提交作者的邮箱，而任何拥有推送权限的人都可以将其设为任意地址。开启命令后，任何能向此仓库推送的人，只要使用某位项目成员已验证的邮箱，就能以该成员身份执行操作。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1571
msgid "Commit commands"
msgstr "提交命令"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1573
msgid ""
"\"Fixes KEY-12\" in a commit on the default branch moves the issue to the"
" fixing status, as the Specivo user whose verified email wrote the "
"commit. Their permissions and the workflow apply."
msgstr ""
"默认分支上的提交中出现“Fixes KEY-12”时，会以提交邮箱经过验证的 Specivo "
"用户身份，将工作项移到修复状态。适用该用户的权限和工作流。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1575
msgid "Fixing status"
msgstr "修复状态"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1577
msgid "Do not change the status"
msgstr "不更改状态"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1585
msgid "Time logging"
msgstr "工时记录"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1587
msgid ""
"\"KEY-12 @1h30m\" (also @2h, @90m, @1.5h) logs the time on the issue for "
"the commit's author, on any branch. They need permission to log time."
msgstr "“KEY-12 @1h30m”（也支持 @2h、@90m、@1.5h）会在任意分支上为提交作者在该工作项上记录工时。作者需要拥有记录工时的权限。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1591
msgid "Merge automation"
msgstr "合并自动化"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1593
msgid ""
"When a pull or merge request that says \"Fixes KEY-12\" is merged into "
"the default branch, the issue moves to the merge status. The change is "
"made by Git, with the project role chosen here, and follows the workflow."
msgstr ""
"当包含“Fixes KEY-12”的拉取请求或合并请求合并到默认分支时，工作项会移到合并状态。此更改由 Git "
"以此处选择的项目角色执行，并遵循工作流。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1596
msgid "Merge status"
msgstr "合并状态"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1598
msgid "Choose a status"
msgstr "选择状态"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1606
msgid "Role of Git in this project"
msgstr "Git 在此项目中的角色"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1612
msgid ""
"The Automation role may edit issues but has no workflow transitions until"
" an administrator grants them. Changing the role needs permission to "
"manage members."
msgstr "Automation 角色可以编辑工作项，但在管理员授予之前没有任何工作流转换。更改角色需要管理成员的权限。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1618
msgid "Ignore pull requests from forks and outsiders"
msgstr "忽略来自派生仓库和外部人员的拉取请求"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1620
msgid ""
"Requests from another repository, or on GitHub by someone who is not a "
"collaborator, are not linked to issues until they are merged."
msgstr "来自其他仓库的请求，或 GitHub 上非协作者提交的请求，在合并之前不会关联到工作项。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1623
msgid "Environment types"
msgstr "环境类型"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1624
msgid ""
"Deployments are grouped by environment type, guessed from the "
"environment's name (\"prod-eu\" is production). List the environments the"
" guess gets wrong. A name ending in * covers every environment that "
"starts with it, such as review/*. Names match in any case."
msgstr ""
"部署按环境类型分组，环境类型根据环境名称推断（\"prod-eu\" 为生产）。请列出推断有误的环境。以 * "
"结尾的名称涵盖所有以此开头的环境，例如 review/*。名称匹配不区分大小写。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1629
msgid "Environment name or prefix*"
msgstr "环境名称或前缀*"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1630
msgid "e.g. github-pages or review/*"
msgstr "例如 github-pages 或 review/*"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1641
msgid "Choose a type"
msgstr "选择类型"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1642
msgid "Production"
msgstr "生产"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1643
msgid "Staging"
msgstr "预发布"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1644
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1649
msgid "Remove this environment"
msgstr "移除此环境"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1658
msgid "Add an environment"
msgstr "添加环境"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1662
msgid ""
"A webhook URL and a secret are generated and shown once after the "
"repository is connected."
msgstr "连接仓库后会生成 Webhook URL 和密钥，并仅显示一次。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1681
msgid "Disconnect repository"
msgstr "断开仓库连接"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1687
msgid ""
"Disconnect this repository? Its webhook URL stops working and its "
"delivery log is deleted. Commit notes already on issues stay."
msgstr "断开此仓库的连接？其 Webhook URL 将失效，投递日志将被删除。工作项上已有的提交备注会保留。"

